  "description": "Cha Kang-Jae's dedicated maid, Han Ji-An, was a calm, picture-like woman. That was until she started peeking at Kang-Jae, growing increasingly attracted to him, and eventually even sneaking a kiss while he was asleep. \n\nHowever, Kang-Jae wasn't actually asleep. So a startled Ji-An apologizes and offers to do whatever he wants. But instead of punishment, Kang-Jae makes an unexpected proposal.\n\n**Original Novel:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8848257) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854905), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14704951)",
